# Frontend — Local Dev (Example)

Created: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC  
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC

## Common Setup
- Install dependencies
- Set up local env vars
- Run dev server + mock API

Example commands:
```sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev
```

## Environment Variables
- Use a `.env.local` for local overrides.
- Keep secrets out of repo; use a secret manager or local untracked file.

## Debug Tips
- Confirm API base URL and auth state first.
- Reproduce in an incognito session to isolate cached state.
- If “only some users”, check feature flags/cohort targeting.

